    "title": "Angi: Hire Home Service Pros",
    "description": "Find a service pro for all your home improvement needs with Angi. Angi gives you access to over 200,000 certified home service professionals, with expertise in everything from remodeling and landscaping to cleaning and handyman projects.\r\n\r\nSince our start in 1995, we\u2019ve helped homeowners complete over 150 million projects and counting. When you bring your project to Angi, we match you to local professionals who suit your needs. You can hire confidently with ratings and verified reviews provided by actual homeowners.\r\n\r\nAngi also lets you access price info, expert guides, and home maintenance planner features instantly \u2014 so you can plan your project and know that you\u2019re in good hands with Angi. \r\n\r\nAngi App Features:\r\n\r\nFIND HIGHLY RATED PROFESSIONALS FOR HOME SERVICES\r\n- Find a home service pro or contractor in your area with verified reviews from other users\r\n- Get matched with skilled pros in 50+ service categories, from moving to plumbing to renovations and more\r\n- See home repair, home remodel, and overall project costs and estimates in your area\r\n- Hire from over 200,000 certified and licensed professionals, including Super Service Award winners\r\n\r\nHIRE A PROFESSIONAL FOR ALL HOME SERVICE PROJECTS\r\n- Home repair, renovation, remodeling, and additions\r\n- House cleaning and maid services\r\n- Kitchen and bathroom remodels\r\n- Roofing\r\n- Windows\r\n- Concrete experts\r\n- Painting\r\n- Heating and furnace systems\r\n- Electricians\r\n- Decks\r\n- Pest control\r\n- Foundations\r\n- Plumbing professional\r\n- Lawn care and maintenance\r\n- Landscaping\r\n- Siding\r\n- Fences\r\n- And much more\r\n\r\nHome improvement is easy with Angi. Download now and hire top professionals to get your jobs done well. \r\n\r\nCalifornia Privacy:\r\nhttps://vault.pactsafe.io/s/a84ad12b-7245-4a12-9fc5-2011a3bf4d62/legal.html#contract-hyia9fa6b",
